# =========================================================================
# Firebase Firestore Live Link Database Configuration
# =========================================================================
# For Live Link Hosting (Render, Vercel, Railway, Heroku, PythonAnywhere, etc.):
# Because serviceAccountKey.json is in .gitignore, set FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS 
# in your cloud host's Environment Variables dashboard as a JSON string or Base64 string.
#
# Option 1: Paste complete JSON string (Single Line or multi-line):
# FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS={"type":"service_account","project_id":"inventorymanagementsyste-e864a",...}
#
# Option 2: Base64 Encoded JSON string (Recommended for Render / Vercel to avoid string escape issues)
# FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS=eyJ0eXBlIjoic2VydmljZV9hY2NvdW50IiwicHJv...
#
# Option 3: Local file path (if running locally or on self-hosted VPS)
# FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS=serviceAccountKey.json
